  "description": "In 2018, we were one of the first bike brands to fit a suspension fork to a production gravel bike, and we immediately foresaw the huge amount of fun to be had ripping along really tough, technical trails. In the current range, the Beyond SUS has a RockShox Rudy XPLR fork with an adjustable 40 mm of travel combined with our multi-purpose Beyond frame and its multitude of mounting points for whatever you have planned. Sram Apex 1 x 11 mechanical provides the shifting, TRP Spyre C callipers the control, and tough but lightweight WTB rims fitted with grippy Venture TCS tyres get you in and out of trouble. Wave goodbye to aching hands and say hello to crazy high-speed technical singletrack detours. Hell yeah!\n\nXS - S 27.5'' x 1.9''\nM - XL 29'' x 2.0''\n\nXS - S 27.5'' x 1.9''\nM - XL 29'' x 2.0''\n\nWeight frame: 2540 g frame (size M, incl. TA, bolts, seatclamp, hanger)",
